28&#x02013;33. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18194162</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR19"><label>19.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Colliver</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The research enterprise in medical education</article-title><source>Teach Learn Med</source><year>2003</year><volume>15</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>154</fpage><lpage>155</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1207/S15328015TLM1503_01</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Colliver JA. The research enterprise in medical education. Teach Learn Med. 2003;15(3):154&#x02013;5. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12855384</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR20"><label>20.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cook</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><name><surname>Beckman</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Bordage</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Quality of reporting of experimental studies in medical education: a systematic review</article-title><source>Med Educ</source><year>2007</year><volume>41</volume><issue>8</issue><fpage>737</fpage><lpage>745</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1365-2923.2007.02777.x</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Cook DA, Beckman TJ, Bordage G. Quality of reporting of experimental studies in medical education: a systematic review. Med Educ. 2007;41(8):737&#x02013;45. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17661881</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR21"><label>21.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stacy</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Spencer</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Assessing the evidence in qualitative medical education research</article-title><source>